  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Protect the Human Rights Act; scrap control orders; reduce pre‑charge detention; extensive civil‑liberties package limiting surveillance; end child detention and create alternatives; asylum seekers to have right to work and no returns to danger; EU cooperation and coordinated EU foreign policy; strong green agenda (zero‑carbon economy, cancel Heathrow third runway, oppose new nuclear, expand renewables); record hate crimes and inclusive admissions in faith schools. TEXT_G: Withdraw from the EU; repeal the Human Rights Act and leave the ECHR; five‑year freeze on settlement and long‑term immigration cap with no amnesty; end government promotion of multiculturalism and restore the Primary Purpose Rule; strong law‑and‑order stance (life means life, double prison capacity, three‑strikes, stronger self‑defence); expand defence and maintain/replace nuclear deterrent; restrict face coverings, deport extremist preachers, reaffirm primacy of UK law over religious courts; regain sovereign control over fisheries/agriculture.",
